cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CaseFile: a KPI intelligence-to-action engine"
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sau
    given-names: Priyadip
    email: saupriyadip571@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/priyadip/BusinessIntelligence.ai-"
abstract: >-
  CaseFile turns a KPI movement into a decision. It decomposes the move,
  ranks candidate causes against a proof ladder, and states the standard of
  evidence each explanation actually meets. Where the data cannot identify a
  cause, it declines to name one and instead ranks the experiments that would
  settle the question by expected net benefit of sampling.
keywords:
  - business intelligence
  - causal inference
  - decision support
  - abstention
  - key performance indicators
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-09-02"
